<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Session Request Confirmation</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
        .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); color: white; padding: 30px; text-align: center; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; }
        .content { background: #f8f9fa; padding: 30px; border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px; }
        .session-details { background: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px 0; border-left: 4px solid #667eea; }
        .footer { text-align: center; margin-top: 30px; color: #666; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>📚 Session Request Sent</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello <strong><%= studentName %></strong>,</p>
            
            <p>Your mentoring session request has been successfully sent to <strong><%= mentorName %></strong>.</p>
            
            <div class="session-details">
                <h3>📋 Session Details</h3>
                <p><strong>Title:</strong> <%= sessionTitle %></p>
                <p><strong>Category:</strong> <%= sessionCategory %></p>
                <p><strong>Start Time:</strong> <%= startTime %></p>
                <% if (endTime) { %>
                <p><strong>End Time:</strong> <%= endTime %></p>
                <% } %>
                <% if (description) { %>
                <p><strong>Description:</strong> <%= description %></p>
                <% } %>
                <% if (agenda) { %>
                <p><strong>Agenda:</strong> <%= agenda %></p>
                <% } %>
                <p><strong>Mentor:</strong> <%= mentorName %> (<%= mentorEmail %>)</p>
                <p><strong>Status:</strong> Pending Confirmation</p>
            </div>
            
            <p>Your mentor has been notified and will respond within 24 hours. You'll receive another email once they confirm or decline the session.</p>
            
            <p><strong>What's Next?</strong></p>
            <ul>
                <li>Wait for your mentor's confirmation</li>
                <li>Prepare any questions or materials for the session</li>
                <li>Check your calendar for the scheduled time</li>
            </ul>
            
            <div class="footer">
                <p>Best regards,<br>SquadCo Hackademy Team</p>
                <p><small>You can view and manage your sessions in your dashboard.</small></p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>